<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-col">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="brand-dot"></span>
        <span>PROJECT IGNIS // AVIONICS ENGINEERING DATASHEET</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-sub">
        Open-source STM32G473VET6 rocket flight computer, 100 Hz X-configuration active fin / TVC stabilization, 3-channel MOSFET pyro igniter stage, dual-EEPROM blackbox recorder, and 433 MHz LoRa ground station.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <div>
        <h4>SUBSYSTEMS</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/#architecture">IGNIS-CORE (STM32G473VET6)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#ecad-explorer">Aux Data Logger (ATmega328P)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#fin-simulator">IGNIS-CTRL (4-Fin X-Mixer)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#firmware">IGNIS-NET-SIM (PyQt6 Ground Station)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>QUICK ROUTES</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">Main Datasheet</a></li>
          <li><a href="/hardware">Hardware Specs</a></li>
          <li><a href="/software">Firmware & Software</a></li>
          <li><a href="/downloads">CAD & Gerber Vault</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <span>DOC ID: IGN-FC-G473-REV2 • HARDWARE: CERN-OHL-P v2 • FIRMWARE: MIT LICENSE</span>
    <span>DESIGNED & ENGINEERED BY SHOURYA PANDEY</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .footer-col {
    max-width: 520px;
  }
  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .brand-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .footer-sub {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }
  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .footer-links h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  .footer-links ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .footer-links li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .footer-bottom {
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
